# Line tabs only

All app tabs use the **line** `TabsList` variant (underline active state). Do not use the muted pill `default` variant.

`TabsList` already defaults to `variant="line"` — omit the prop unless you must set it explicitly.

```tsx
// ✅
<Tabs defaultValue="visits">
  <TabsList>
    <TabsTrigger value="visits">Visits</TabsTrigger>
  </TabsList>
</Tabs>

// ✅ Explicit (same as default)
<TabsList variant="line">…</TabsList>

// ❌
<TabsList variant="default">…</TabsList>
```

See `design.md` → Components → Tabs.
